        },
        {
          "text": "Alume namwi, amendzeni achetu enu dza viratu Jesu arivyomendza afuasie hata achidzilavya afwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafwa ili atakase atue na ubatizo kpwa kuhumira nenore, na kuatenga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akale a haki na bila lawama. Andaphokera atue dza viratu bwana arusi aphokeravyo bibi arusi wa nguma, mana kana dowa wala chochosi chii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Viratu Jesu arivyomendza atue, chila mlume naye ni lazima amendze mchewe. Mana amendzaye mchewe, anadzimendza mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Takuna yezira mwiriwe, ela nkuurerato na kuutundza. Vivyo hivyo Jesu naye nkuhutundzato swiswi atue, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kpwa vira hu vilungo vya mwiriwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama Maandiko gaambavyo, “Kpwa sababu hiyo, mlume andaricha ise na nine, agbwirane na mchewe, nao osi airi andakala mwiri mmwenga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maneno higa gana ukpweli uriodzifwitsa, mana ganahusu Jesu na atue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nakuambirani, chila mlume ni lazima amendze mchewe dza viratu adzimendzavyo mwenye, na chila mchetu naye ni lazima amuogophe mlumewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
